; MIDI has no sound of its own: choose MMLisp > MIDI > Output (a synth, a
; sound module, a DAW) to hear it. A voice named for a GM instrument is its
; program — gm-flute, gm-strings1, or a role such as piano — and :prog 0–127
; picks any.
; Try: give ch2 a bass, gm-bass-finger (or :prog 33).
(def-score :target midi)
(ch1 gm-flute :oct 5 :len 4 c e g e)
(ch2 :oct 2 :len 2 c g)
